WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.020
Your mind is racing.

2
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.380
Does that mean you’ve lost your peace

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:06.860
with God?

4
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:08.920
Romans five says that,

5
00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.100
since we’ve been justified by faith,

6
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.100
we have peace with God through

7
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.220
our Lord Jesus Christ.

8
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.060
Paul is describing what Christ has secured

9
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:17.680
for us.

10
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.320
The conflict our sin created has been

11
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:20.740
answered.

12
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.780
Those who trust Jesus stand in grace.

13
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.500
Your feelings may still be unsettled.

14
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.580
You don’t have to make yourself calm

15
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.000
before you can come to him.

16
00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.920
Set the phone down for a moment.

17
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.640
Tell him what’s troubling you.

18
00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:35.260
Read that promise again.

19
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.400
Through Jesus,

20
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.380
you have peace with God.

21
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.800
Let his grace be the ground beneath

22
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.940
this anxious day.
